<title>JAPAN: Bandai shares up in Tokyo morning on merger news.</title>
<headline>Bandai shares up in Tokyo morning on merger news.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Bandai Co Ltd rose in early Tokyo trade on Friday, following news of its plan to merge with Sega Enterprises Ltd from October 1, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0014 GMT, Bandai shares were trading up 80 yen at 2,640 yen in turnover of 279,000.</p>
